{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">跑馬地天主教聖彌額爾墳場有墓園被破壞，警方拘捕一名87歲男子。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GRAVE-1530.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bMnJSnPlhC1788163978.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.GRAVE-1530.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事墓園的水泥地損毀。據了解，涉事墳場的保安員上月24日中午巡邏時，發現墓園懷疑遭破壞，於是報案。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方經調查，本月4日拘捕一名87歲男子，他否認犯案，稱自己當時在場維修。案件由灣仔警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T08:19:55.543934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}